        },
        "quote": "(a) Created. There is hereby established the Topeka and Shawnee County Library District Board of Trustees. The Board shall administer the Topeka and Shawnee County Library and shall have the powers and duties as set forth in K.S.A. 12-1266 and amendments thereto. The Board shall conduct its business in accordance with K.S.A. 12-1260 et seq. and any amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.205.040:block:0#text",
